  "$comment": "Hand-authored paraphrase groups for the vocabulary-convergence harness. Each variant is the strict claim an agent would extract from its prose. subjectKey is the agent's own guess (treated like heuristic extraction, so the subject ranker may redirect it to an existing subject); expectedSubjectKey is the shared subject a converged KB should use. converge=true means every variant must end with the same logical signature and domain-redundancy must pair them; converge=false marks controls (different obligations) and known gaps (property-key paraphrase) that must NOT share a signature.",
